      "raw": "# ColorPicker assets\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "ColorPicker assets"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000002",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 2,
      "end_line": 2,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 3,
      "raw": "`hue-ring.png` is the unmodified 448 × 448 Figma export from ColorPickerPanel / Wheel (`885:43344`), rendered at 224 × 224 logical pixels. The source component set is `885:44522` in file `0GkItQYSNIR0lZ3iJhfJzc`.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 4,
      "end_line": 4,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "The ring's red origin is at the bottom; hue advances counterclockwise in screen coordinates. Interactive color planes and the triangle are rendered from current channel values by `ColorPickerSurface`. The eyedropper reuses LVRS `resources/iconset/imagecolorPicker.svg`, the same scaled source glyph as the Figma action.\n"
    }
  ],
